The mitochondrial density is expressed as number of mitochondria per myofiber area far from myofiber periphery (intermyofibrillar mitochondria) or per cytoplasmic area surrounding myonuclei (perinuclear mitochondria). Scatter dot plots show individual values, mean ± SD. *
